%% HANDWRITTEN. Checked against ARCHITECTURE.md S12 + D33 + D27
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant SYS as ReadyCall
    participant AI as Analysis
    participant A as Agent
    participant STORE as readycall store

    C->>SYS: hangs up
    SYS->>SYS: IN_CALL to WRAP_UP
    Note over SYS,A: ACW is a REAL STATE, not a gap (D33).<br/>The agent is not offered a new call during it.

    par the customer is asked to rate
        SYS->>C: "ให้คะแนน 1 ถึง 5"
        C->>SYS: presses 4
    and the agent gets a head start
        SYS->>AI: summarise the whole call
        AI-->>A: PRE-FILLED summary + suggested disposition
        Note right of AI: pre-filled, never auto-saved.<br/>The agent owns the record.
    end

    A->>A: edits the summary
    A->>SYS: picks a disposition, adds follow-ups
    A->>SYS: presses Done

    alt Done pressed
        SYS->>SYS: WRAP_UP to RATING to CLOSED
    else ACW timer expires (~45s)
        SYS->>SYS: auto-close, flagged as timer-ended
        Note right of SYS: measured, because a team constantly<br/>hitting the timer is a staffing signal
    end

    SYS->>STORE: transcript, brief versions, decisions, timings, ratings
    Note over STORE: BOTH sides rate (D27) - the agent rates the<br/>call quality too, which is how we learn whether<br/>the brief was actually any good
